      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The latest API version is 202604. Use this version in the LinkedIn-Version header for all API requests to access the most recent features and improvements.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieve InMail Stub Profiles - CRM Connect",
      "Anchor": "retrieve-inmail-stub-profiles---crm-connect",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The InMail Stub Profile API allows you to retrieve basic profile data of LinkedIn members that have replied to InMails sent from Recruiter seat holders. When InMails are sent from Recruiter seatholders to members, the initial reply to that InMail asks the member if they would be willing to share their contact information with the Recruiter. On reply, if they elect to share, a subset of that member\u0027s profile data (mailStub) will be retrievable with this API. The stub profile data can then be stored in your application database. If a member does not share their contact info, a mailStub will not be stored for the member.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieve InMail Stub Profiles - CRM Connect",
      "Anchor": "retrieve-inmail-stub-profiles---crm-connect",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "All API requests require authorization . Additionally, API requests return paged results; details on paging through results can be found here.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieve InMail Stub Profiles - CRM Connect",
      "Anchor": "retrieve-inmail-stub-profiles---crm-connect",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Retrieve stub profiles for a contract:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Retrieve InMail Stub Profiles - CRM Connect",
      "Anchor": "retrieve-inmail-stub-profiles---crm-connect",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "GET https://api.linkedin.com/v2/mailStubs?q=contract",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
